    "Claude Code 的用量额度用完了，等恢复后再试，或到设置 → 整理工具先换成 Codex 或 API。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code is out of usage until it resets. Try again then, or switch to Codex or an API in Settings → Summarizer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code 还没登录或登录已过期，请重新登录后再试一次（终端命令：claude auth login）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code isn’t signed in, or its sign-in has expired. Sign in again and try once more (Terminal command: claude auth login)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code 还没登录，登录之后才能整理（终端命令：claude auth login）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code isn’t signed in. Sign in to summarize (Terminal command: claude auth login)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code、Claude Desktop、Codex 等支持 MCP 的 AI 工具可以搜索、读你的会议记录和逐字稿（只能读、不能改），拾音不用开着。读到的内容会交给那个 AI 工具处理，跟整理会议记录一样会离开这台电脑。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI tools that support MCP, such as Claude Code, Claude Desktop and Codex, can search and read your meeting notes and transcripts (read-only), even when Shiyin isn't open. What they read is handled by that AI tool and leaves this Mac, just like when meeting notes are written."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code、Claude Desktop、Codex 等支持 MCP 的 AI 工具可以直接读拾音的会议：到「设置 → 高级 → AI 工具（MCP）」打开「让 AI 工具读取会议」，再按「加到 Claude Code」「加到 Codex」或「加到 Claude Desktop」。其他工具用「复制」自己粘贴设置。拾音不用开着。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI tools that support MCP, such as Claude Code, Claude Desktop and Codex, can read your Shiyin meetings directly: in Settings › Advanced › AI tools (MCP), turn on “Let AI tools read meetings”, then click “Add to Claude Code”, “Add to Codex” or “Add to Claude Desktop”. For other tools, use Copy and paste the settings yourself. Shiyin doesn't need to be open."
          }
        }
      }
    },
