            "value": "No text could be read from “%@”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「录音与转录」：录音来源和麦克风、会议语言、正式转录的引擎和模型、要不要实时逐字稿和说话者识别、在线会议的提醒和快捷键。「正式转录」可以选 Breeze ASR 25（建议，联发科的台湾模型，会参考词汇表）、Qwen3-ASR（阿里巴巴开源，多人会议漏字少，全程本机）或 macOS 内置（不用下载模型、速度快，但英文专有名词比较容易错）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording & Transcription: audio source and microphone, meeting language, the final-transcription engine and models, live transcript and speaker identification, online-meeting alerts and shortcuts. Final transcription can use Breeze ASR 25 (recommended; MediaTek's Taiwanese model, uses your glossary), Qwen3-ASR (open-sourced by Alibaba; drops fewer words in multi-speaker meetings, runs entirely on this Mac), or the macOS built-in recognizer (no model download and fast, but English terms are more often wrong)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「整理工具」：选 Claude、Codex（需要先安装并登录对应的 CLI），或填 Anthropic、OpenAI 的 API key。觉得整理太慢，可以在「模型」填比较快的模型，例如 sonnet。最下面的「模板」内置五种；也可以复制一份来改，或自己添加段落与指示。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summarizer: choose Claude or Codex (install and sign in to the CLI first), or enter an Anthropic or OpenAI API key. If summarizing feels slow, enter a faster model under Model, such as sonnet. Templates are at the bottom: five built in; copy one to customize it, or add your own sections and instructions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「说话者与词汇」：拾音认识的人和他们的声纹，可以改名、删除，或关掉记住声音的功能；词汇表加入系统名、产品名、人名的正确写法，这对专有名词的正确率影响很大。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speakers & Glossary: the people Shiyin recognizes and their voiceprints, which you can rename or delete, or turn off remembering voices; the glossary holds the correct spelling of system names, product names and people's names, which greatly improves proper-noun accuracy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「高级 → 企业服务器」：公司的服务器、你的账号，可以选要不要用它转录、整理，或退出登录。整理工具选「公司」就用公司设置的模型。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Advanced → Enterprise server”: your company’s server and your account. Choose whether to use it for transcription and summaries, or sign out. With the “Company” summarizer, notes are written by the model your company set up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「高级」：检查更新（有新版时拾音会询问，同意后自动下载、验证并重新打开；也可以从「拾音」菜单选「检查更新…」）、环境检查、录音和模型占用的空间。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Advanced: check for updates (when a new version is available Shiyin asks, then downloads, verifies and relaunches; also available from the Shiyin menu → Check for Updates…), environment check, and the space used by recordings and models."
          }
        }
      }
    },
