      }
    },
    "会参考词汇表，中英夹杂、专有名词比较准；联发科开源的台湾模型，需要下载约 1.7 GB。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses your glossary, so mixed Chinese-English and proper nouns come out better; MediaTek's open-source Taiwanese model, about 1.7 GB to download."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会参考词汇表，多人会议的漏字和同音字比 Breeze 少、速度快三成；阿里巴巴开源的模型，全程在这台 Mac 上跑、不连网，输出是简体中文；需要下载约 2.5 GB 的模型。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses your glossary; drops fewer words in multi-speaker meetings and confuses fewer homophones than Breeze, about 30% faster. An open-source model from Alibaba that runs entirely on this Mac with no network access; Chinese output is Simplified Chinese. Requires a 2.5 GB model download."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会打开 %@ 的登录页，用公司账号登录。登录后录音交给公司的服务器转录，整理也用公司设置的模型。": {
