    },
    "会议中一起讨论的文档（演示文稿、规格书、报价单…）。整理会议记录、提问时会一起参考；也可以把文档拖进窗口": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Documents discussed in the meeting (slides, specs, quotes…). Used when writing notes and answering questions. You can also drag documents into the window"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议中一起讨论的文档（演示文稿、规格书、报价单、白板照片）可以加进会议：会议标题下回纹针图标的菜单（还没有文档时写「加入文档」）选「加入文档…」，或把 PDF、Word、PowerPoint、图片拖进窗口。纯文字、Markdown 要从「加入文档…」选（拖进来的 txt 会当成逐字稿、md 会当成笔记）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Documents discussed in a meeting (slides, specs, quotes, whiteboard photos) can be added to it: in the paperclip menu below the meeting title (“Add Documents” when there are none yet), choose “Add Documents…”, or drag PDF, Word, PowerPoint, or image files into the window. Plain text and Markdown files have to be chosen with “Add Documents…” (a dragged txt file becomes a transcript, an md file becomes notes)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议主要内容": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
