            "value": "Meeting text size"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议可以分文件夹：在会议上按右键（或「更多」）选「移到文件夹」→「新文件夹…」。侧栏上方的「文件夹」可以切换只看某个文件夹；正在看某个文件夹时，新录的和导入的会议都会放进去。文件夹按右键可以重命名或删除（会议会保留）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Organize meetings in folders: right-click a meeting (or use “More”) and choose “Move to Folder” → “New Folder…”. Use “Folders” at the top of the sidebar to show one folder; while you're in a folder, new recordings and imports go into it. Right-click a folder to rename or delete it (its meetings are kept)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
