    "使用 %@ 附的 codex（这台 Mac 没有另外安装 Codex CLI）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Using the codex bundled with %@ (Codex CLI isn't installed separately on this Mac)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用说明": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guide"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如项目名称或客户名称。这场会议会移进新文件夹。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example, a project or client name. This meeting will be moved into the new folder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：「上个月跟客户谈过哪些价格？」「寄信的机制最后怎么决定的？」拾音会先找出相关的会议片段，再请整理工具回答，回答附上是哪一场会议、哪个时间点。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: “What prices did we discuss with clients last month?” or “What did we decide about sending email?” Shiyin first finds the relevant parts of your meetings, then asks the summarizer. Answers show which meeting and what time each point comes from."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：「谁负责寄信的部分？」「最后决定的上线日期是哪一天？」回答只根据这场会议的会议记录和逐字稿，每一点都附上时间，点了就能听原话。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: “Who's handling the email part?” or “What launch date did we settle on?” Answers use only this meeting's notes and transcript, and every point has a time you can click to hear what was said."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：小明": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: Alex"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "依会议记录画成心智图。PNG 适合贴到聊天软件、演示文稿；SVG 可以再用其他软件编辑。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Draws the meeting notes as a mind map. PNG works well in chats and slides; SVG can be edited in other apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "依各文件的文件名或修改日期": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From each file's name or modification date"
          }
        }
      }
    },
