      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The company server doesn't offer a summary model yet. Please contact your administrator."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "公司的服务器还没有提供整理用的模型：请管理者在服务器后台的「整理模型」加上模型。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The company server doesn't offer a summary model yet. Ask your administrator to add one under Models in the server's admin console."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "公司的服务器还没登录或登录已失效，请到设置 → 高级 → 企业服务器登录": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
