    "加好之后在 AI 工具里直接问，例如「列出我这周的会议」「上周所有会议的待办有哪些」「找出提到预算的会议，整理成一段给主管」，也可以跟其他工具一起用（把待办开成工单、写周报）。回答里的会议链接点了会打开拾音、跳到那个时间点。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Then just ask in the AI tool, for example “List my meetings this week”, “What are the action items from last week's meetings?” or “Find the meetings that discussed the budget and summarize them for my manager”. It also works together with your other tools (turning action items into tickets, writing a weekly report). Meeting links in the answers open Shiyin at that moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "包含录音、逐字稿、说话者、会议记录、笔记和重点标记。传给同事后，对方双击就能导入拾音。": {
