        }
      }
    },
    "只能读、不能改；垃圾桶里的会议、正在录的会议读不到。读到的会议内容会交给那个 AI 工具处理，跟整理会议记录一样会离开这台 Mac；关掉开关就读不到了。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read-only: AI tools can't change anything, and meetings in the Trash or still being recorded aren't available. The meeting content they read is handled by that AI tool and leaves this Mac, just like when meeting notes are written. Turn the switch off to stop access."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只送这一条的题目；有回答的交给整理工具依答案修正，略过的直接移除。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the questions for this item are sent; answered ones go to the summarizer to revise the notes, skipped ones are removed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只重新分辨谁在说话，逐字稿的文字不会变": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only works out again who is speaking; the transcript text stays the same"
