        }
      }
    },
    "只重新分辨谁在说话，逐字稿的文字不会变。人多、吵杂或手机远距收音时，告诉拾音大约几个人会分得比较准。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only works out again who is speaking; the transcript text doesn't change. With many people, a noisy room or a phone recording from across the table, telling Shiyin roughly how many people there are helps."
