      }
    },
    "开": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开 Zoom、Teams、Google Meet 等在线会议时，拾音会提醒你开始录音；会议好像结束时提醒停止。不想被某个 app 提醒，在提醒上按「不要再提醒」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you join a Zoom, Teams, Google Meet or other online meeting, Shiyin asks whether to start recording, and reminds you to stop when the meeting seems to be over. To stop the reminders for an app, click “Don't Ask for This App” on the reminder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启会中提问助手": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable meeting question assistant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，会前资料和录音中的实时定稿文字会交给当前选择的整理工具处理，约每 30 秒分析一次。可以在录音时随时关闭。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, your preparation and finalized live transcript are sent to your selected AI provider about every 30 seconds. You can turn this off while recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始使用": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Get Started"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始录音": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start Recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始录音后听约 10 秒，判断是哪一种语言（%@）；跟会议语言不同而且有把握时会自动切换，录音画面可以改回来。需要 60 MB 的语言检测模型。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After recording starts, listens for about 10 seconds to tell which language is spoken (%@). If it differs from the meeting language and the result is confident, it switches automatically; you can switch back on the recording screen. Needs the 60 MB language detection model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始录音（⌘R），用%@识别；点右边的箭头可以改录音来源和语言": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start recording (⌘R) in %@; click the arrow to change the recording source and language"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始或停止录音": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start or stop recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始截取系统声音": {
