        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording, transcription or summarizing is in progress. Update when it's done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录音按钮旁的箭头、录音画面也可以换麦克风。蓝牙耳机连着时，系统默认可能会自动变成耳机的麦克风，现场会议请选这台 Mac 的麦克风。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can also switch microphones from the arrow next to Record and on the recording screen. When Bluetooth headphones are connected, the system default may switch to their microphone; for in-person meetings, choose this Mac’s microphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
