    "整理": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summarizing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理、回答待确认、提问、猜说话者时，会把逐字稿文字、你的笔记、加入的文档读出来的文字和词汇表送到你选的整理工具，录音档和文档的源文件不会送出。选「不整理」就完全离线。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When writing notes, answering questions to confirm, asking questions, or guessing speakers, the transcript text, your notes, the text read from added documents, and the glossary are sent to the summarizer you chose. Recordings and the original document files are never sent. Choose “Don't summarize” to stay fully offline."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理、提问、猜说话者时会把逐字稿文字、你的笔记、词汇表和会议基本资料送到 %@。录音档不会送出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When summarizing, answering questions or guessing speaker names, the transcript text, your notes, the glossary and basic meeting details are sent to %@. The recording is never sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理、提问、猜说话者时会把逐字稿文字、你的笔记、词汇表和会议基本资料送到 %@。录音档不会送出。用 http 发送没有加密，建议改用 https。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When summarizing, answering questions or guessing speaker names, the transcript text, your notes, the glossary and basic meeting details are sent to %@. The recording is never sent. http isn't encrypted; use https if you can."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理、提问、猜说话者时会把逐字稿文字、你的笔记、词汇表和会议基本资料送到 %@（公司的服务器），再由公司设置的模型整理。录音档不会因为整理而送出。": {
