    "整理中：%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summarizing: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理会议记录、提问时，文档读出来的文字会一起送给整理工具，帮忙看懂讨论、写对数字和名称。记录还是以会议中讲的为准，用到文档的地方会注明出处，会议说的跟文档不一样时会列成待确认。已经整理好的会议加了文档，按记录上方的「刷新会议记录」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When writing notes or answering questions, the text read from the documents is sent along to the summarizer to help it follow the discussion and get numbers and names right. The notes still follow what was said in the meeting: where a document is used, the source is cited, and where the meeting and a document disagree, it becomes a question to confirm. If the meeting already has notes, click “Summarize Again” above the notes after adding documents."
          }
        }
      }
    },
