      }
    },
    "整理时有 %lld 题不确定的地方，点了就能回答": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld things the summary wasn't sure about; click to answer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理时有一题不确定的地方，点了就能回答": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One thing the summary wasn't sure about; click to answer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理时没把握的人名、专有名词、负责人和期限会列成待确认的题目。记录里有疑问的那一条旁边会有「？」，点了就能当场回答；记录顶部的「还有 N 题待确认」点开可以一次看完。能用是或否回答的直接按「是」「不是」（按「是」不用等整理工具），其他的在「你的回答」字段回答，按「送出」，会议记录就会依你的答案修正；看不懂或不重要的按「略过」，或一次「全部略过」。也可以按「编辑」直接改。改错了按「编辑」旁的「复原上一版」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Names, terms, owners and due dates the AI was unsure about become items to confirm. The affected line in the notes shows a “?”; click it to answer right there, or open “N items to confirm” at the top of the notes to go through them all. Yes/no questions have Yes and No buttons (Yes needs no AI call); type other answers in the answer field, then press Submit and the notes are revised accordingly. Skip anything unclear or unimportant, or Skip all at once. You can also press Edit to change the notes directly. If something goes wrong, use Restore previous version next to Edit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
