    "每天送一份匿名的使用统计给拾音的开发者：版本、系统、录音和转录了几分钟、用了哪些功能、失败几次和哪一种失败。不会送会议标题、逐字稿、会议记录、人名、声纹或任何文件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once a day, Shiyin sends its developer an anonymous summary: version, system, minutes recorded and transcribed, which features were used, and how many tasks failed and of what kind. It never sends meeting titles, transcripts, notes, names, voiceprints or any files."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每天送一份匿名的使用统计（版本、系统、录音和转录的分钟数、用了哪些功能、失败的次数和种类），不含任何会议内容。在设置 → 高级可以关掉。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once a day, Shiyin sends an anonymous usage summary (version, system, minutes recorded and transcribed, which features were used, and how many tasks failed and of what kind) that never includes meeting content. You can turn it off in Settings → Advanced."
