            "value": "Transcription failed: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "转录完会自动整理。「记录」标签页由上而下是摘要、决议、待办、未决问题和依议题分段的讨论；每一条后面的时间点点一下，就从录音那里开始播放。上方的「条列｜心智图」可以把记录画成心智图，一眼看出有哪些议题。右上角的模板菜单可以换成一对一、访谈、课堂／演讲、脑力激荡等格式，换完从「更多 → 重新处理」选「刷新会议记录」。想找某件事，可以在「提问」标签页直接问，例如「预算最后决定多少？」，回答会附上时间点；工具列的「提问」可以一次问所有会议。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes are generated automatically after transcription. The Notes tab runs top to bottom: summary, decisions, action items, open questions, then the discussion by topic; click the timestamp after any line to play the recording from there. Switch “List | Mind map” at the top to draw the notes as a mind map and see every topic at a glance. The template menu at the top right switches to formats such as one-on-one, interview, lecture or brainstorming; after changing it, choose More → Reprocess → Regenerate Notes. To find something, ask directly on the Ask tab, for example “What was the final budget?”; answers include timestamps. The Ask button in the toolbar searches every meeting at once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "转录完成": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription complete"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "转录完成、会议记录整理好时通知你。": {
